  "sm_name": "Navin Fluorine International Limited",
  "sort_date": "2026-11-12 19:20:38",
  "symbol": "NAVINFLUOR",
  "voiceSummary": "Navin Fluorine International Limited intimates that its plant for the manufacture and supply of hydrofluorocarbons R32 has commenced commercial operations on November 12, 2026. The facility has an additional capacity of up to 15,000 metric tons per annum R32 equivalent quantity at the Surat unit. The plant will be ramped up progressively. This follows the Board of Directors' approval on October 30, 2025, for funding of 236.50 Crores for this project. The intimation is filed under Regulation 30 of SEBI Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements Regulations, 2015.",
