  "sm_isin": "INE048G01018",
  "sm_name": "Navin Fluorine International Limited",
  "sort_date": "2026-11-11 14:37:21",
  "symbol": "NAVINFLUOR",
  "voiceSummary": "Navin Fluorine International Limited intimated the schedule for analyst and institutional investor meetings on November 16, 2026, and November 17, 2026. The interactions will take place at the 360 One-Trinity Asia Conference in a physical mode, featuring one-on-one and group meetings. The company will present information based on publicly available data. Concurrently, the company reported consolidated sales of Rs. 2,235.8 Cr and operating EBITDA of Rs. 764.5 Cr for the half-year ended September 2026, representing year-on-year growth of 51% and 69% respectively. Operating EBITDA margin stood at 34.2%. For the quarter ended September 2026, sales were Rs. 1,190.7 Cr with operating EBITDA of Rs. 407.5 Cr. The company highlighted revenue growth across HPP, Specialty Chemicals, and CDMO verticals, alongside ongoing capital expenditure projects including HFC capacity expansion and a cGMP4 facility.",
